Description: Only the library and the tools are configured and built
 The packages ship only libgnutls, libgnutlsxx, their headers and
 pkg-config file, and the command-line tools. Without doc, extra,
 libdane, guile, po, tests and fuzz in AC_CONFIG_FILES and SUBDIRS,
 automake and configure do not read their makefiles. The x86 assembly
 is neither configured nor listed in lib/accelerated's SUBDIRS. src/gl does
 not build its tests directory. The Guile and gtk-doc checks are gone,
 so the build does not need guile.m4 or gtk-doc.m4. Without the
 GNUmakefile link, make reads neither GNUmakefile nor maint.mk and
 cfg.mk. ldd.sh is not made, because nothing uses it. p11tool and
 tpmtool are not built, so their option files are not built either.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-05
